{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Seed Audio 1.5 视频翻配接口",
    "description": "Seed Audio 1.5 视频翻配接口。把视频中的中文或英文对白翻译成 30 种目标语言之一并重新配音，保留原画面，可返回成片与双语字幕。",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.evolink.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "bearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/audios/generations": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Seed Audio 1.5 视频翻配",
        "description": "> 🚧 **该模型暂未开放，敬请期待**\n\n- 把视频中的**中文或英文**对白翻译成 `30` 种目标语言之一并重新配音，保留原画面；不需要提示词\n- 默认同时返回配好音的视频，可选返回目标语言字幕和原语言字幕\n- 异步处理模式，使用返回的任务ID [进行查询](/cn/api-manual/task-management/get-task-detail)，提交后不支持取消\n- 生成的链接有效期为 7 天，请尽快保存\n\n**计费说明：**\n- 按配音的时长计费（与视频时长相同），按秒计，不足 1 秒按 1 秒计\n- 提交时按视频时长预扣积分（`usage.credits_reserved`，余额需足够；读不到视频时长时按 `6` 分钟上限预扣），完成后按实际时长结算，多退少补；失败全额退还\n\n**任务结果（`status` 为 `completed` 时）：**\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| `results[0]` / `result_data[0].audio_url` | 配好音的音频链接 |\n| `result_data[0].duration` | 音频时长（秒） |\n| `result_data[0].video_url` | 配好音的视频链接，`return_video` 为 `true`（默认）时返回 |\n| `result_data[0].subtitles` | 目标语言字幕，`[{\"format\": \"srt\", \"url\": \"…\"}, {\"format\": \"jsonl\", \"url\": \"…\"}]`，是字幕文件的下载链接，有效期与音频链接相同；jsonl 文件每行一句及起止时间（秒） |\n| `result_data[0].source_subtitles` | 原语言字幕，结构与 `subtitles` 一致 |\n| `usage.billed_seconds` / `usage.credits_used` | 计费秒数 / 实际消耗积分 |",
        "operationId": "createSeedAudio15VideoDubbing",
        "tags": [
          "音频生成"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedAudio15Request"
              },
              "examples": {
                "basic": {
                  "summary": "翻配成日语并返回双语字幕",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
                    "video_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/interview.mp4"
                    ],
                    "target_language": "ja",
                    "dialogue_enhancement": "medium",
                    "glossaries": [
                      {
                        "source": "EvoLink",
                        "target": "EvoLink"
                      }
                    ],
                    "subtitles": true,
                    "source_subtitles": true
                  }
                },
                "custom_subtitle": {
                  "summary": "按自己的译文配音",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
                    "video_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/interview.mp4"
                    ],
                    "target_language": "en",
                    "custom_subtitle_url": "https://example.com/interview.en.srt",
                    "subtitles": true
                  }
                },
                "audio_only": {
                  "summary": "只要配好的音频",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
                    "video_urls": [
                      "https://example.com/interview.mp4"
                    ],
                    "target_language": "zh",
                    "return_video": false,
                    "format": "mp3"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "音频生成任务创建成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SeedAudioResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "missing_parameter",
                    "message": "target_language is required for seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未认证、Token无效或过期",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "unauthorized",
                    "message": "Invalid or expired token",
                    "type": "authentication_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "配额不足、需要充值",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "insufficient_quota",
                    "message": "Insufficient quota. Please top up your account.",
                    "type": "insufficient_quota"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "无权限访问",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "model_access_denied",
                    "message": "Token does not have access to model: seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
                    "type": "invalid_request_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "请求频率超限",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "rate_limit_exceeded",
                    "message": "Too many requests, please try again later",
                    "type": "rate_limit_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "服务器内部错误",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "internal_error",
                    "message": "Internal server error",
                    "type": "api_error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "SeedAudio15Request": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "video_urls",
          "target_language"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型名称",
            "enum": [
              "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing"
            ],
            "default": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing",
            "example": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing"
          },
          "video_urls": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "要翻配的视频\n\n- 只支持 `1` 个\n- 视频里要有清晰的中文或英文对白\n\n**视频要求：**\n- 只支持公网可访问的链接\n- 时长 `4` ~ `360` 秒，帧率 `12` ~ `60` fps\n- 格式：`mp4` / `mov`，大小 ≤ `200 MB`\n- 宽、高各 `300` ~ `6000` 像素，宽高比 `0.4` ~ `2.5`，宽×高 `407,696` ~ `2,086,876`（`1280×720`、`1920×1080` 都可以；`640×480` 太小，`4K` 太大）",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uri"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 1,
            "example": [
              "https://example.com/clip.mp4"
            ]
          },
          "target_language": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "目标语言，区分大小写\n\n| 代码 | 语言 |\n|---|---|\n| `zh` | 中文 |\n| `en` | 英语 |\n| `ja` | 日语 |\n| `ko` | 韩语 |\n| `de` | 德语 |\n| `fr` | 法语 |\n| `pt-BR` | 葡萄牙语（巴西） |\n| `pt-PT` | 葡萄牙语（葡萄牙） |\n| `es-ES` | 西班牙语（西班牙） |\n| `es-MX` | 西班牙语（墨西哥） |\n| `th` | 泰语 |\n| `id` | 印尼语 |\n| `vi` | 越南语 |\n| `ms` | 马来语 |\n| `fil` | 菲律宾语 |\n| `it` | 意大利语 |\n| `ru` | 俄语 |\n| `nl` | 荷兰语 |\n| `pl` | 波兰语 |\n| `tr` | 土耳其语 |\n| `sv` | 瑞典语 |\n| `ar` | 阿拉伯语 |\n| `fi` | 芬兰语 |\n| `da` | 丹麦语 |\n| `no` | 挪威语 |\n| `cs` | 捷克语 |\n| `hu` | 匈牙利语 |\n| `el` | 希腊语 |\n| `ro` | 罗马尼亚语 |\n| `hi` | 印地语 |",
            "enum": [
              "zh",
              "en",
              "ja",
              "ko",
              "de",
              "fr",
              "pt-BR",
              "pt-PT",
              "es-ES",
              "es-MX",
              "th",
              "id",
              "vi",
              "ms",
              "fil",
              "it",
              "ru",
              "nl",
              "pl",
              "tr",
              "sv",
              "ar",
              "fi",
              "da",
              "no",
              "cs",
              "hu",
              "el",
              "ro",
              "hi"
            ],
            "example": "ja"
          },
          "dialogue_enhancement": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "人声增强程度\n\n- `off`：不增强\n- `low` / `medium` / `high`：增强程度依次提高\n\n不传时使用默认设置",
            "enum": [
              "off",
              "low",
              "medium",
              "high"
            ],
            "example": "medium"
          },
          "glossaries": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "术语表，固定品牌名、人名等词的译法\n\n- 每一项写成 `{\"source\": \"原文\", \"target\": \"译文\"}`，两边都不能为空\n- 最多 `1000` 对\n- 不能和 `custom_subtitle_url` 同时传：同时传时任务失败，不扣费",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "source",
                "target"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "source": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "原文中的词"
                },
                "target": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "希望使用的译法"
                }
              }
            },
            "maxItems": 1000,
            "example": [
              {
                "source": "EvoLink",
                "target": "EvoLink"
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom_subtitle_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "您自己译好的**目标语言**字幕链接；传入后按这份字幕配音，不再自动翻译\n\n- 公网可访问的 `srt` 文件，UTF-8 编码\n- 每条字幕不超过 `15` 秒\n- 不能和 `glossaries` 同时传，固定译法请直接写进字幕文件",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://example.com/interview.ja.srt"
          },
          "return_video": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否同时返回配好音的视频\n\n- `true`：返回（默认），链接在任务结果的 `result_data[0].video_url`\n- `false`：不返回，只返回音频",
            "default": true,
            "example": true
          },
          "subtitles": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否返回目标语言字幕\n\n- `true`：任务结果里同时返回 `srt` 和 `jsonl` 两种字幕文件的下载链接\n- `false`：不返回（默认）",
            "default": false,
            "example": true
          },
          "source_subtitles": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "是否返回原语言字幕（视频原有对白的字幕）\n\n- `true`：任务结果里同时返回 `srt` 和 `jsonl` 两种字幕文件的下载链接\n- `false`：不返回（默认）",
            "default": false,
            "example": true
          },
          "format": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "输出音频格式\n\n- `wav`（默认）\n- `mp3`\n- `ogg_opus`：只支持 `48000` 采样率\n- `pcm`：不带文件头的原始音频数据（16 位），普通播放器无法直接播放，需要自行处理",
            "enum": [
              "wav",
              "mp3",
              "pcm",
              "ogg_opus"
            ],
            "default": "wav",
            "example": "mp3"
          },
          "sample_rate": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "输出采样率（Hz）\n\n- `wav` / `mp3` / `pcm` 可选下列任一值，默认 `44100`\n- `ogg_opus` 只能为 `48000`，不传时自动使用 `48000`",
            "enum": [
              8000,
              16000,
              24000,
              32000,
              44100,
              48000
            ],
            "default": 44100,
            "example": 24000
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务完成后的HTTPS回调地址\n\n**回调时机：**\n- 任务完成（completed）、失败（failed）或取消（cancelled）时触发\n- 在计费确认完成后发送\n\n**安全限制：**\n- 仅支持HTTPS协议\n- 禁止回调到内网IP地址（127.0.0.1、10.x.x.x、172.16-31.x.x、192.168.x.x等）\n- URL长度不超过`2048`字符\n\n**回调机制：**\n- 超时时间：`10`秒\n- 失败后最多重试`3`次（会分别在失败的`1`秒/`2`秒/`4`秒后进行重试）\n- 回调响应体格式与任务查询接口返回的格式一致\n- 回调地址若返回2xx状态码视为成功，其他状态码会触发重试",
            "format": "uri",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/webhooks/audio-completed"
          }
        }
      },
      "SeedAudioResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "created": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务创建时间戳",
            "example": 1795776000
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务ID",
            "example": "task-unified-1795776000-abcd1234"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "实际使用的模型名称",
            "example": "seed-audio-1.5-video-dubbing"
          },
          "object": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio.generation.task"
            ],
            "description": "任务的具体类型"
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "任务进度百分比 (0-100)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 100,
            "example": 0
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "任务状态",
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "example": "processing"
          },
          "task_info": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioTaskInfo",
            "description": "音频任务详细信息"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "audio"
            ],
            "description": "任务的输出类型",
            "example": "audio"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AudioUsage",
            "description": "使用量和计费信息"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioTaskInfo": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "can_cancel": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "任务是否可以取消（本模型提交后不支持取消）",
            "example": false
          },
          "estimated_time": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "预估完成时间(秒)",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 20
          },
          "audio_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "音频任务类型",
            "example": "video_dubbing"
          }
        }
      },
      "AudioUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "使用量信息",
        "properties": {
          "credits_reserved": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "预扣积分数（按视频时长预扣，读不到视频时长时按 6 分钟上限；任务完成后按实际时长结算，多退少补）",
            "minimum": 0,
            "example": 4.76
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误代码标识符"
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误描述信息"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "错误类型"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "description": "##所有接口均需要使用Bearer Token进行认证##\n\n**获取 API Key：**\n\n访问 [API Key 管理页面](https://evolink.ai/dashboard/keys) 获取您的 API Key\n\n**使用时在请求头中添加：**\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "音频生成",
      "description": "Seed Audio 1.5 音频生成相关接口"
    }
  ]
}
